  <item>
    <title>06.和建筑师道工聊聊：从西班牙朝圣之路到荷兰红灯区的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6984bf4cc78b823892dc96a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6984bf4cc78b823892dc96a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 00:11:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生是无边的旷野，每次踏上征途都将是一场冒险。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个人的生活都有一千种奇妙体验的可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档分享无尽旷野中所见所闻和那些会在心灵深处荡漾着感动的博客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期特邀朋友】</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><span>道道</span></p><span></span><p><span>建筑师，曾在加泰罗尼亚理工学院攻读建筑学硕士，在西班牙留学的一年里，曾穿越三毛笔下的撒哈拉沙漠；环勃朗峰12天的重装徒步；还曾探访过荷兰红灯区。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下图是道道的环勃朗峰徒步时候拍下的：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtJYNdAoOgM4ebyaM3g8wmN65waE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【主持】</span></p><span></span><p><span>双子木Dean</span></p><span></span><p><span>摄影师、建筑师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 徒步中最崩溃的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 徒步中如何克服孤单</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 可乐才是徒步中的救赎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 最期待的下次徒步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="621">10:21</a> 初探三毛笔下的撒哈拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 染缸是臭的，不分国界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 非洲不养I人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 锡瓦真的是埃及最棒的小众旅行地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1144">19:04</a> 老城的骗子为什么会这么多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> 地中海南岸的海边城市被欧洲文化入侵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> “美食”探索频道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1438">23:58</a> 探访荷兰红灯区，他真的进去了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1854">30:54</a> 建筑师的建筑朝圣之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">37:29</a> 在挪威的海边蒸桑拿跳海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2349">39:09</a> 一年的留学旅行经历会获得什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2437">40:37</a> 如果有来世真想投胎在霞慕尼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 或许是《朝圣之路》这部电影让我喜欢上了徒步，但是有无数条朝圣之路可以通向圣地亚哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 徒步可以让人的生命变得强烈而被感知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2929">48:49</a> 徒步很公平，公平到每一个人都值得被保护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3011">50:11</a> 《白日梦想家》追寻的25号底片，你也要去寻觅了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3164">52:44</a> 人生的第一雪山应该留给四姑娘山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 中国的多洛米蒂——川西加米峰，看到云海的这场徒步值了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> 朝圣之路不只是一条路</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计：双子木 储钰</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目制作：双子木</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计：双子木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【互动方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：wubiankuangye@163.com / Wechat:shuangzimu0522</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：shuangzimu0522</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6626594fc3e09d8f37b8bbc8/luTJSboydICp3gWbiyZkhpXTgUqv.m4a" length="59698884" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUxFeMAf2l0REcaDHQXpI1VKuEw.jpg"/>
