  <item>
    <title>04.欧洲老贵族的礼仪生涯遭遇滑铁卢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67215d3e33c798676ff57b6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67215d3e33c798676ff57b6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Oct 2024 00:34:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生是无边的旷野，每次踏上征途都将是一场冒险。</span></p><span></span><p><span>每个人的生活都有一千种奇妙体验的可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档分享无尽旷野中所见所闻和那些会在心灵深处荡漾着感动的博客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主持】</span></p><span></span><p><span>双子木</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅行者、摄影师、建筑师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 为什么参加网球比赛输了要哭呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 直男思维无法解释的事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="641">10:41</a> 欧洲老贵族热情邀请我们喝咖啡，被拒绝后，内心产生了小情绪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 如何礼貌的婉拒别人的邀请？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 如何给足情绪价值，充满激情地接受别人的邀请？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【制作团队】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计 双子木</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目制作 双子木</span></p><span></span><p><span>logo设计 双子木</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别感谢 Gavin</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【互动方式】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：wubiankuangye@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：lhy708968289</span></p>]]></description>
